0..79 Comment "// A handler over a theory: the scope takes `State.Eff` as its interface, fixes"
80..154 Comment "// the stored sort `S` at `Integer` where it names the theory, and answers"
155..222 Comment "// each operation by a clause, or names a model of the theory whose"
223..298 Comment "// operations answer them, or leaves that to the one model of the theory in"
299..376 Comment "// scope. The carrier `C` is what the scope answers; `get` replies an integer"
377..449 Comment "// to its continuation, and `put` sends one and is replied the unit. The"
450..523 Comment "// kernel replays each scope as the fold of `State.Eff`\'s free model, one"
524..599 Comment "// constructor per operation, and a scope the model in scope answers as the"
600..625 Comment "// one naming that model."
627..653 Comment "// The theory `State.Eff`."
654..660 Keyword "import"
661..662 StringLit "\""
662..675 StringLit "./state.gandr"
675..676 StringLit "\""
676..677 Other ";"
