1158..1232 Comment "/// The state-passing model answers the scope in place of written clauses:"
1233..1306 Comment "/// each operation is the model\'s, so the subject computes a value of its"
1307..1382 Comment "/// carrier, a function of the initial state. Storing four and then reading"
